TaskLocal Trust & Safety Dashboard

The TaskLocal Trust & Safety Dashboard helps monitor the health and safety of the marketplace by giving the team visibility into reported incidents, flagged users, provider/customer activity, and potential risks.

Key Features
Incident Monitoring: Review and track reported safety issues.
Risk & Flagging: Identify accounts or activity that may require attention.
Case Management: Track incidents from initial report through resolution.
User Safety: View relevant customer and provider information when investigating issues.
Dashboard Insights: Quickly identify trends and areas that need action.

The goal is to help TaskLocal respond to safety concerns quickly, protect users, and maintain trust across the marketplace.
